WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.887 --> 00:00:22.022
[looped distorted dialogue]

2
00:00:31.596 --> 00:00:32.597
[gasping sound]

3
00:00:36.688 --> 00:00:38.038
[breathing heavily]

4
00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:02.366
[engine revving]

5
00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.826
[breathing heavily]

6
00:01:37.662 --> 00:01:38.707
[sniffs]

7
00:01:44.365 --> 00:01:45.670
Okay.

8
00:01:51.894 --> 00:01:54.505
- Hey, what the fuck? Hey, hey.
- Easy. Don't move.

9
00:01:54.679 --> 00:01:56.768
[speaks Russian]

10
00:01:56.942 --> 00:01:58.529
[in English] You're making
big mistake, you know that?

11
00:01:58.553 --> 00:01:59.553
Shut the fuck up.

12
00:01:59.641 --> 00:02:00.990
- Let's go.
- Fuck.

13
00:02:03.253 --> 00:02:06.996
[speaks indistinctly][Joel] Get the door.
Shut the fuck up.

14
00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:09.868
Watch the fucking jacket,
man. It's new.[Joel] Shut the fuck up!

15
00:02:10.042 --> 00:02:12.088
[high-pitched beeping]

16
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:19.269
[beeping stops]

17
00:02:19.443 --> 00:02:22.185
Listen to me.
You alert your brother

18
00:02:22.359 --> 00:02:24.970
and I shoot you in the back of the head,
you understand me?

19
00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.451
Okay. You're the boss.

20
00:02:29.061 --> 00:02:30.150
Slow.

21
00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.854
[brother] Yo, yo, yo!

22
00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.858
You remember
my pumpkin frappé, huh?

23
00:02:46.688 --> 00:02:48.864
[gunman] Don't! Don't.

24
00:02:49.038 --> 00:02:51.345
Touch it and he's
fucking dead. Hands up!

25
00:02:52.998 --> 00:02:56.045
Jesus Christ, you dumb motherfucker.
Do you know who we are?

26
00:02:56.219 --> 00:02:58.613
Yeah, I know who you
fucking are. Last January,

27
00:02:58.787 --> 00:03:01.181
the two of you shot an
innocent mother and a kid.

28
00:03:01.355 --> 00:03:03.139
Killed 'em. In Newark.

29
00:03:03.313 --> 00:03:07.274
[chuckles] Oh, yeah? Says who?
Who the fuck are you, huh?

30
00:03:11.103 --> 00:03:12.757
I brought something
to give you.

31
00:03:12.931 --> 00:03:13.976
[brother] Uh-huh?

32
00:03:15.412 --> 00:03:17.458
But you have to watch
what I'm doing.

33
00:03:19.547 --> 00:03:20.722
You watching?

34
00:03:22.071 --> 00:03:25.117
[brother] Oh! No![groaning]

35
00:03:26.249 --> 00:03:28.730
No! No!

36
00:03:33.952 --> 00:03:35.215
[gunman groans]

37
00:03:39.088 --> 00:03:40.742
[brother groans, coughs]

38
00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:43.658
Oh, shit. No, no, no.

39
00:03:43.832 --> 00:03:45.921
No, no, no. Fuck!

40
00:03:46.095 --> 00:03:48.053
[coughing]
Fuck, fuck, fuck.

41
00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:50.839
No, don't die.
Don't die, don't die![chokes]

42
00:03:51.013 --> 00:03:53.276
Fuck! Fuck. Look at me.

43
00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:56.584
Look at me, you motherfucker,
you can't die! You can't die!

44
00:03:56.758 --> 00:03:58.542
It needs somebody
to fucking pass to.

45
00:03:58.716 --> 00:04:00.892
If you die, it won't
fucking work. Look at me!

46
00:04:01.066 --> 00:04:04.200
Stay alive, you piece of shit.
Stay alive, you piece of shit!

47
00:04:04.374 --> 00:04:06.550
[gasps][breathing heavily]

48
00:04:07.899 --> 00:04:09.640
[chokes, gurgles]

49
00:04:13.818 --> 00:04:15.907
Oh, G... No.

50
00:04:17.692 --> 00:04:19.041
Oh, no.

51
00:04:20.172 --> 00:04:23.828
Oh, no. [grunting]

52
00:04:28.006 --> 00:04:30.444
Fuck. Fuck.

53
00:04:30.618 --> 00:04:32.141
Fuck!

54
00:04:33.229 --> 00:04:36.101
Now it has no one
to pass to, fuck!

55
00:04:37.146 --> 00:04:38.887
[bottles clattering]

56
00:04:39.061 --> 00:04:40.192
Fuck. Fuck.

57
00:04:40.367 --> 00:04:41.411
No, no, no!

58
00:04:41.585 --> 00:04:43.326
- Who the fuck are you?
- No one.

59
00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.024
- Who the fuck are you?
- I'm Lewis.

60
00:04:46.198 --> 00:04:48.960
- I'm no one. I'm no one. I'm literally no one.
- What the fuck you doing here?

61
00:04:48.984 --> 00:04:50.333
- Don't shoot me.
- Answer me!

62
00:04:50.507 --> 00:04:52.161
What the fuck
are you doing here?

63
00:04:52.335 --> 00:04:53.902
I just buy from them, okay?

64
00:04:54.076 --> 00:04:56.426
I fucking hate those guys.
I hate them, too!

65
00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.925
I fucking hate them,
especially him!

66
00:04:57.949 --> 00:04:59.473
Please, don't shoot me.

67
00:05:02.258 --> 00:05:04.260
I didn't know
anybody else was here.

68
00:05:04.956 --> 00:05:07.263
Okay, fuck it.

69
00:05:07.437 --> 00:05:10.484
I didn't fucking know
anybody else was here!

70
00:05:11.746 --> 00:05:13.574
I fucked this whole thing up.

71
00:05:13.748 --> 00:05:16.446
I fucked this whole thing up
and I'm sorry.

72
00:05:18.274 --> 00:05:19.667
This wasn't meant for you.

73
00:05:19.841 --> 00:05:21.016
What?

74
00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.757
This wasn't meant for you.

75
00:05:22.931 --> 00:05:24.280
What wasn't meant for me?

76
00:05:26.195 --> 00:05:29.198
- I'm sorry.
- What? What are you... Fuck.

77
00:05:29.372 --> 00:05:31.156
What are you sorry for?

78
00:05:33.898 --> 00:05:34.943
Fuck.

79
00:05:35.813 --> 00:05:38.207
- I'm sorry.
- What?

80
00:05:44.344 --> 00:05:45.693
Yo,

81
00:05:45.867 --> 00:05:47.477
who the fuck is that?

82
00:05:48.609 --> 00:05:49.871
Oh, shit.

83
00:05:50.741 --> 00:05:51.786
Ah!

84
00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.396
Fuck!

85
00:05:54.441 --> 00:05:56.443
[gang member]
Who has the goddamned key?

86
00:06:00.534 --> 00:06:02.362
Come on! Fuck!

87
00:06:07.802 --> 00:06:09.847
[straining]

88
00:06:13.198 --> 00:06:15.505
- [buyer] No, no, no, no, don't shoot!
- Shit.

89
00:06:15.679 --> 00:06:19.117
- [gang member] Fuck! Alexi and Yev are fucking dead!
- Oh, fuck.

90
00:06:20.641 --> 00:06:22.469
Get that piece of shit!

91
00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:24.819
Open it!

92
00:06:26.342 --> 00:06:28.736
Break the fucking door down!

93
00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.651
Break it! Break it!

94
00:06:30.825 --> 00:06:32.479
[banging]

95
00:06:33.001 --> 00:06:34.263
Go! Go!

96
00:06:35.569 --> 00:06:38.049
Move! Move![grunting, panting]

97
00:06:39.442 --> 00:06:41.009
Shoot the motherfucker!

98
00:06:41.183 --> 00:06:42.663
[gunshots]

99
00:06:44.099 --> 00:06:45.100
[car horn honks]

100
00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.885
[screeching, crashing]

101
00:06:48.059 --> 00:06:49.713
[gang member laughs]
Problem solved.

102
00:06:49.887 --> 00:06:51.672
[dogs barking in distance]

103
00:07:35.063 --> 00:07:36.499
[electricity crackling]

104
00:08:14.885 --> 00:08:18.149
[singer]
<i>♪ I already grieved you ♪</i>

105
00:08:18.323 --> 00:08:21.631
<i>♪ So say what you want, but ♪</i>

106
00:08:21.805 --> 00:08:25.200
<i>♪ This time
I don't believe you ♪</i>

107
00:08:25.374 --> 00:08:26.897
<i>♪ While you been
Talking circles ♪</i>

108
00:08:27.071 --> 00:08:29.030
<i>♪ Every time you got caught ♪</i>

109
00:08:29.204 --> 00:08:34.209
<i>♪ I already grieved you
Grieved you ♪</i>

110
00:08:34.383 --> 00:08:35.819
[applause]

111
00:08:35.993 --> 00:08:39.040
Thank you, everybody.
Now, nearly one year ago,

112
00:08:39.214 --> 00:08:42.826
singer/songwriter
and pop superstar Skye Riley

113
00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.134
was fighting for her life
after being injured in a car accident.

114
00:08:46.308 --> 00:08:49.964
An accident that also
tragically took the life

115
00:08:50.138 --> 00:08:51.705
of actor Paul Hudson.

116
00:08:51.879 --> 00:08:54.185
Today, for her first
public interview

117
00:08:54.359 --> 00:08:55.447
since the accident,

118
00:08:55.622 --> 00:08:57.101
ladies and gentlemen,

119
00:08:57.275 --> 00:08:59.190
the one and only Skye Riley.

120
00:08:59.364 --> 00:09:01.062
[cheering, applause]

121
00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:10.985
[Skye] Oh, my God, Drew!

122
00:09:12.029 --> 00:09:14.205
Thank you so much
for having me.

123
00:09:15.424 --> 00:09:17.948
So happy to be doing this
with you.

124
00:09:18.122 --> 00:09:21.125
I mean, I have got to say that
you look incredible in person.

125
00:09:21.299 --> 00:09:23.539
- [Skye] Oh, my gosh. As do you.
- Your hair... I'm obsessed.

126
00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:26.043
Oh, my God. My hair. I was
just trying something new.

127
00:09:26.217 --> 00:09:28.326
- I'm not sure if I'm pulling it off.
- Um, I... What do we think?

128
00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:30.178
[cheering, applause][Skye] Oh, my God.

129
00:09:30.352 --> 00:09:32.006
[Drew] Well, I think
you have your answer.

130
00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:34.486
Now you've announced
new tour dates... Yes.

131
00:09:34.661 --> 00:09:37.707
...actually kicking off
right here in New York City

132
00:09:37.881 --> 00:09:40.623
next week. Is this
an emotional comeback?

133
00:09:40.797 --> 00:09:43.757
Yes, a lot of different emotions,
you know, with this one.

134
00:09:43.931 --> 00:09:47.108
- A year ago, you had just won a Grammy.
- Mm-hmm.

135
00:09:47.282 --> 00:09:50.807
- You were in the middle of a big world tour.
- Mm.

136
00:09:50.981 --> 00:09:53.810
And then you hit
this rough patch.

137
00:09:53.984 --> 00:09:55.986
"Rough patch" might
be generous.

138
00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.728
I was wondering
if you could share anything

139
00:09:58.902 --> 00:10:00.861
from that period of your life.

140
00:10:01.035 --> 00:10:04.038
I was dealing with
a lot of stress and pressure

141
00:10:04.212 --> 00:10:05.779
from the demands of the tour.

142
00:10:05.953 --> 00:10:09.217
And I should have
asked for help, but

143
00:10:09.391 --> 00:10:12.916
instead I drowned it all out
with...

144
00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:17.399
drugs and alcohol
and a lot of bad decisions.

145
00:10:17.573 --> 00:10:19.923
And I let myself get
completely out of control.

146
00:10:20.097 --> 00:10:22.970
And actually, I want to
take this opportunity

147
00:10:23.144 --> 00:10:25.625
to apologize to my fans,

148
00:10:25.799 --> 00:10:29.585
my loved ones, my team.

149
00:10:29.759 --> 00:10:32.893
Everyone who was counting on me
and supporting me.

150
00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:36.418
I let you all down and...

151
00:10:37.158 --> 00:10:38.681
I promise

152
00:10:38.855 --> 00:10:41.031
that will never
happen again.

153
00:10:41.205 --> 00:10:43.077
[cheering, applause]
So, thank you.

154
00:10:45.122 --> 00:10:47.559
You were in the hospital.
When you got out,

155
00:10:47.734 --> 00:10:51.607
what has the time been like
between then and now?

156
00:10:52.913 --> 00:10:55.132
[screams]

157
00:10:56.481 --> 00:10:59.267
I spent a lot of time
looking inward.

158
00:11:01.486 --> 00:11:04.664
Relearning how to
appreciate life sober.

159
00:11:05.882 --> 00:11:08.015
And I'm...

160
00:11:08.189 --> 00:11:10.539
I'm just so grateful
for this second chance,

161
00:11:10.713 --> 00:11:12.672
and I don't want to waste it.

162
00:11:20.157 --> 00:11:22.812
Car's waiting right
outside by the curb.

163
00:11:22.986 --> 00:11:24.814
There's a bit of a crowd.

164
00:11:26.686 --> 00:11:29.558
[muffled screaming, cheering]

165
00:11:35.738 --> 00:11:37.131
Skye!

166
00:11:39.437 --> 00:11:41.613
[no audible dialogue]

167
00:11:48.185 --> 00:11:50.971
- My name is Ashley.
- So nice to meet you.

168
00:11:55.976 --> 00:11:57.020
[screams]

169
00:12:01.111 --> 00:12:03.200
That went really well.

170
00:12:03.374 --> 00:12:05.420
- You were perfectly graceful.
- Yeah.

171
00:12:05.594 --> 00:12:07.596
Skye, you've got
Instagram and TikTok

172
00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:10.425
seriously blowing up
right now.[Skye singing on earphones]

173
00:12:10.599 --> 00:12:14.646
You're trending number two on Twitter.
I mean, you should really be so proud...

174
00:12:14.821 --> 00:12:16.910
[Skye on earphones]
<i>♪ There's no medicine ♪</i>

175
00:12:17.084 --> 00:12:19.303
<i>♪ To change me ♪</i>

176
00:12:19.477 --> 00:12:21.392
<i>♪ I'm goin' crazy! ♪</i>

177
00:12:21.566 --> 00:12:24.744
<i>♪ Doctor, I need a new brain ♪</i>

178
00:12:24.918 --> 00:12:26.833
<i>♪ Lost in a spiral ♪</i>

179
00:12:27.007 --> 00:12:29.836
<i>♪ Keep making old mistakes
Again ♪</i>

180
00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:32.447
<i>♪ Uh-oh, gimme a new brain ♪</i>

181
00:12:32.621 --> 00:12:34.405
<i>♪ Stuck in a cycle ♪</i>

182
00:12:34.579 --> 00:12:37.844
<i>♪ If I don't stop
I'll end up dead ♪</i>

183
00:12:38.018 --> 00:12:41.673
<i>♪ Can you change my thoughts?
Can you make 'em clean? ♪</i>

184
00:12:41.848 --> 00:12:45.373
<i>♪ Can you clear my head?
Can you fix my dreams? ♪</i>

185
00:12:45.547 --> 00:12:48.376
<i>♪ Doctor, I'm goin' insane ♪</i>

186
00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:53.381
<i>♪ I've got a bad mind
Give me a new brain ♪</i>

187
00:12:53.555 --> 00:12:57.777
<i>♪ I've got a sweet tooth For bad decisions
My mind is wired wrong ♪</i>

188
00:12:57.951 --> 00:13:01.215
- Good.
<i>- ♪ It won't take long Till I'm the villain ♪</i>

189
00:13:01.389 --> 00:13:04.261
<i>♪ Put me under
Anything you can uncover ♪</i>

190
00:13:04.435 --> 00:13:07.003
<i>♪ Make me forget my wonders
Make me forget... ♪</i>

191
00:13:07.177 --> 00:13:09.353
Eyes up!

192
00:13:09.527 --> 00:13:13.270
<i>♪ Do you think
Someone could save me? ♪</i>

193
00:13:13.444 --> 00:13:17.144
<i>♪ Curious, can you erase me? ♪</i>

194
00:13:17.318 --> 00:13:21.235
<i>♪ There's no medicine
To change me ♪</i>

195
00:13:22.149 --> 00:13:24.151
<i>♪ I'm goin' crazy! ♪</i>

196
00:13:24.325 --> 00:13:27.458
<i>♪ Doctor, I need a new brain ♪</i>

197
00:13:27.632 --> 00:13:29.678
<i>♪ Lost in a spiral ♪</i>[Skye grunts]

198
00:13:29.852 --> 00:13:31.375
[music stops]

199
00:13:31.549 --> 00:13:32.724
Are you okay?

200
00:13:32.899 --> 00:13:34.378
What happened?

201
00:13:34.552 --> 00:13:36.511
Are you hurt?

202
00:13:36.685 --> 00:13:38.208
Yep, I'm fine.

203
00:13:38.382 --> 00:13:41.472
I'm fine. I think
I just took a weird step.

204
00:13:41.646 --> 00:13:43.866
Let's take a break, everyone.
Can we get some ice?

205
00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.346
Anton, I'm fine. I'm fine.

206
00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:47.739
- Skye.
- Can we please just go again?

207
00:13:47.914 --> 00:13:49.239
- I want to get it right, okay?
- Okay.

208
00:13:49.263 --> 00:13:50.457
- Let's go.
- Let's go again.

209
00:13:50.481 --> 00:13:51.874
- [Anton] Line up!
- Rewind it.

210
00:13:52.048 --> 00:13:53.789
- Yep.
- Back to one.

211
00:13:54.616 --> 00:13:56.400
Music.

212
00:13:56.574 --> 00:13:58.576
[Skye on speakers]
<i>♪ Give me a new brain ♪</i>

213
00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.013
<i>♪ I've got a sweet tooth ♪</i>

214
00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:41.619
[knocking]

215
00:14:42.446 --> 00:14:43.708
Shit!

216
00:14:44.579 --> 00:14:46.102
One second!

217
00:14:53.544 --> 00:14:54.894
Yeah, come in.

218
00:14:56.025 --> 00:14:57.331
Hey.[Skye sighs]

219
00:14:57.505 --> 00:14:58.636
You okay?

220
00:14:59.942 --> 00:15:01.683
- You ready to go?
- Yeah, Mom.

221
00:15:01.857 --> 00:15:03.293
I just need a minute.

222
00:15:05.078 --> 00:15:07.950
You should feel really good
about today.

223
00:15:09.299 --> 00:15:10.300
I know.

224
00:15:12.302 --> 00:15:13.303
I do.

225
00:15:13.782 --> 00:15:14.826
Good.

226
00:15:17.742 --> 00:15:19.396
We're ready whenever you are.

227
00:15:26.577 --> 00:15:29.363
Final rehearsal is
confirmed for Wednesday.

228
00:15:29.537 --> 00:15:31.384
So we'll be at the venue
first thing in the morning.

229
00:15:31.408 --> 00:15:34.063
You have a fitting,
photo shoot,

230
00:15:34.237 --> 00:15:37.153
then stage walk-throughs,
then a fan meet-and-greet.

231
00:15:37.327 --> 00:15:39.068
Please go straight to bed
when you get home.

232
00:15:39.242 --> 00:15:40.896
It's going to be a long day.

233
00:15:43.551 --> 00:15:45.683
Oh, and reminder:
Darius gets in tomorrow.

234
00:15:45.857 --> 00:15:47.990
He's gonna be here for opening.

235
00:15:48.164 --> 00:15:50.993
I want him
to feel the love, please.

236
00:15:51.167 --> 00:15:53.387
The label is advancing
a lot of money on this tour.

237
00:15:53.561 --> 00:15:55.606
Have I ever not been
good with Darius?

238
00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:58.566
Darius adores you, obviously.

239
00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.308
Just want you to remember
who's paying the bill.

240
00:16:02.439 --> 00:16:03.484
[message alert]

241
00:16:16.149 --> 00:16:18.064
Hey, straight to bed, Skye.

242
00:16:18.238 --> 00:16:19.239
Good night.

243
00:16:22.242 --> 00:16:23.243
Miss Riley.

244
00:16:24.026 --> 00:16:26.768
[car horns honking]

245
00:16:30.815 --> 00:16:34.906
[pedestrians chattering][sirens wailing]

246
00:16:51.619 --> 00:16:52.837
[sighs]

247
00:16:55.275 --> 00:16:56.754
Hey.

248
00:16:56.928 --> 00:16:59.105
[breathes shakily, grunts]

249
00:17:01.281 --> 00:17:03.587
[grunting]
What the fuck, Lewis?

250
00:17:03.761 --> 00:17:06.721
