00:59:33.831 --> 00:59:37.269
<i>♪ Part the sea
You should get out of my way ♪</i>

748
00:59:37.443 --> 00:59:39.750
<i>♪ I'm holding glass in my hand
And it could break ♪</i>

749
00:59:39.924 --> 00:59:41.839
<i>♪ Something so physical ♪</i>

750
00:59:42.013 --> 00:59:46.321
<i>♪ Made me a cynical disaster
Waiting to happen ♪</i>

751
00:59:46.495 --> 00:59:49.586
<i>♪ Like blood on white satin ♪</i>

752
00:59:55.461 --> 00:59:57.463
<i>♪ It's like the switch
Of an engine ♪</i>

753
00:59:57.637 --> 01:00:00.684
<i>♪ I think I broke
All the brakes ♪</i>

754
01:00:03.469 --> 01:00:07.734
<i>♪ Am I defective? Cuz I'm dying
To make stupid mistakes ♪</i>

755
01:00:08.735 --> 01:00:11.825
<i>♪ Oh, might be a tragedy ♪</i>

756
01:00:12.696 --> 01:00:13.696
[snaps]

757
01:00:13.740 --> 01:00:15.524
Oh, fuck!

758
01:00:16.134 --> 01:00:17.134
God!

759
01:00:19.746 --> 01:00:22.183
Oh, my God! Fuck!

760
01:00:22.357 --> 01:00:24.490
Oh, fuck, fuck! [screams]

761
01:00:24.664 --> 01:00:26.710
Fuck![music stops]

762
01:00:26.884 --> 01:00:29.843
Oh, God.
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck.

763
01:00:32.846 --> 01:00:33.934
Are you okay?

764
01:00:34.108 --> 01:00:35.675
My leg!

765
01:00:35.849 --> 01:00:38.330
- What happened? What's wrong?
- My...

766
01:00:45.467 --> 01:00:47.208
Who was that?

767
01:00:47.382 --> 01:00:49.297
One of you was out of place
and knocked me over!

768
01:00:49.471 --> 01:00:51.430
Who was it?

769
01:00:51.604 --> 01:00:53.432
Skye, I don't think
that's what happened.

770
01:00:53.606 --> 01:00:56.217
Do not tell me
what I just experienced, Anton!

771
01:00:56.391 --> 01:00:58.567
I'm not.

772
01:00:58.742 --> 01:01:01.701
I'm just saying
that from where I was watching,

773
01:01:01.875 --> 01:01:03.224
I didn't see anyone
out of place.

774
01:01:15.759 --> 01:01:17.238
Skye!

775
01:01:44.222 --> 01:01:46.267
[breathes shakily]

776
01:02:10.552 --> 01:02:13.120
[breathing shakily]

777
01:02:25.480 --> 01:02:26.743
[tears]

778
01:02:27.656 --> 01:02:29.136
[grunts]

779
01:02:29.310 --> 01:02:31.399
- What happened?
- Where is Joshua?

780
01:02:31.573 --> 01:02:33.488
Christ, what did you do?

781
01:02:33.662 --> 01:02:35.926
Hey. Everything okay?
Can I get you anything?

782
01:02:36.100 --> 01:02:37.536
What the fuck
is your problem, man?

783
01:02:37.710 --> 01:02:39.233
[chuckles]

784
01:02:39.407 --> 01:02:42.062
- Sorry, what?
- Are you fucking with me?

785
01:02:42.236 --> 01:02:45.172
- I have no idea what you're talking about, I swear.
- He trashed my dressing room!

786
01:02:45.196 --> 01:02:48.547
- What? Wha... No, I didn't!
- I fucking saw you, Joshua!

787
01:02:48.721 --> 01:02:51.289
Skye! I... Skye.
I would never,

788
01:02:51.463 --> 01:02:53.639
ever do something
like that to you, okay?

789
01:02:53.813 --> 01:02:55.859
Like, come on.
What reason would I have?

790
01:02:58.035 --> 01:02:59.993
- Fuck you. Fuck you!
- Okay.

791
01:03:00.167 --> 01:03:02.387
Fuck you! Fuck you, Joshua!

792
01:03:02.561 --> 01:03:04.121
- Fuck you!
- All right. That's enough.

793
01:03:04.258 --> 01:03:06.086
Mom, you need to believe me.
He did this!

794
01:03:06.260 --> 01:03:08.523
- He fucking did this!
- You need to cool off.

795
01:03:08.697 --> 01:03:10.438
You're not actually
taking his side?

796
01:03:10.612 --> 01:03:12.614
I am on your side,
okay? Always.[scoffs]

797
01:03:12.789 --> 01:03:15.443
But Joshua has been
with me the entire day.

798
01:03:15.617 --> 01:03:18.533
What? What are you
even talking about?

799
01:03:18.707 --> 01:03:21.147
I don't even care what happened
in here, we'll get it fixed.

800
01:03:21.275 --> 01:03:23.843
I just need you to...
[scoffs]...tell me the truth.

801
01:03:24.017 --> 01:03:25.897
I'm gonna ask you something...[glass breaking]

802
01:03:26.063 --> 01:03:27.673
...and I want you
to be honest with me.

803
01:03:27.847 --> 01:03:30.719
Skye? Are you using again?

804
01:03:30.894 --> 01:03:32.069
What?

805
01:03:32.243 --> 01:03:33.548
Nobody has to know.

806
01:03:33.722 --> 01:03:35.899
You just have to
tell me the truth.

807
01:03:36.073 --> 01:03:39.119
Oh, my God, no!
I am not using again, Mom.

808
01:03:39.293 --> 01:03:41.469
You want me
to take a drug test?

809
01:03:42.296 --> 01:03:43.602
Okay.

810
01:03:43.776 --> 01:03:45.822
I believe you. Um...

811
01:03:47.867 --> 01:03:49.651
What's going on?

812
01:03:49.826 --> 01:03:52.089
I don't know! I don't know!
I just...

813
01:03:53.525 --> 01:03:57.659
Fuck, I feel crazy all the time.
Everything's going wrong.

814
01:03:57.834 --> 01:04:01.925
Nobody will fucking listen to me
and everyone fucking hates me.

815
01:04:02.099 --> 01:04:04.623
Oh, come on, do you hear
yourself? Everybody loves you.

816
01:04:04.797 --> 01:04:08.105
We're all here for you. We're
here because we believe in you.

817
01:04:08.279 --> 01:04:10.498
We believe in this tour.

818
01:04:10.672 --> 01:04:13.240
I think doing this tour
was a huge mistake. It's...

819
01:04:13.414 --> 01:04:16.678
- It's too much. I'm not... I'm not ready for it.
- Okay, you know what?

820
01:04:16.853 --> 01:04:19.594
We're gonna, um, look at the
book tonight. Look at the dates,

821
01:04:19.768 --> 01:04:22.032
carve out some time for you
to decompress before opening.

822
01:04:22.206 --> 01:04:24.382
But right now
you need to pull it together

823
01:04:24.556 --> 01:04:26.558
and get back out there.

824
01:04:26.732 --> 01:04:29.132
Because we need to be on time
for Darius's foundation event.

825
01:04:29.300 --> 01:04:31.737
Fuck, no. Mom, please
don't make me do that.

826
01:04:31.911 --> 01:04:34.479
I can't get out on stage
in front of a bunch of people tonight.

827
01:04:34.653 --> 01:04:36.394
- Skye.
- Mom, you're not...

828
01:04:36.568 --> 01:04:38.744
Fuck, you're not
listening to me!

829
01:04:38.918 --> 01:04:40.659
I am not in the headspace

830
01:04:40.833 --> 01:04:42.791
to put on a fucking dress
and play dancing monkey

831
01:04:42.966 --> 01:04:46.186
- in front of a room full of strangers!
- Darius is counting on you

832
01:04:46.360 --> 01:04:48.101
to be there, okay?

833
01:04:48.275 --> 01:04:49.929
You gave him your word.[stammers]

834
01:04:50.103 --> 01:04:52.845
You are a woman
who keeps her word.

835
01:04:53.019 --> 01:04:55.326
You are not gonna cancel
on a commitment

836
01:04:55.500 --> 01:04:57.197
to underprivileged youth

837
01:04:57.371 --> 01:05:00.113
right before launching a tour.

838
01:05:21.134 --> 01:05:25.704
[host] <i>Music Inspires Hope
was founded on the idea</i>

839
01:05:25.878 --> 01:05:27.967
<i>that no dream could be too big.</i>

840
01:05:28.141 --> 01:05:29.969
[fly buzzing]

841
01:05:30.143 --> 01:05:32.885
<i>With the help and support
of everyone in this room</i>

842
01:05:33.059 --> 01:05:35.714
<i>and from all of our donors
across the country,</i>

843
01:05:35.888 --> 01:05:37.803
<i>the foundation has been able</i>

844
01:05:37.977 --> 01:05:41.589
<i>to reach more families
this year than ever before.</i>

845
01:05:41.763 --> 01:05:42.763
[fly buzzing]

846
01:05:42.895 --> 01:05:44.375
[host] <i>Thanks to you,</i>

847
01:05:44.549 --> 01:05:47.117
<i>more and more children
every day</i>

848
01:05:47.291 --> 01:05:51.556
<i>are able to make
their wildest dreams a reality.</i>

849
01:05:51.730 --> 01:05:54.733
<i>And now without further ado,</i>

850
01:05:54.907 --> 01:05:57.257
<i>it is my great pleasure</i>

851
01:05:57.431 --> 01:05:59.303
<i>to introduce...</i> Ten seconds.

852
01:05:59.477 --> 01:06:02.915
<i>...a wonderful young artist.
Ladies and gentlemen,</i>

853
01:06:03.089 --> 01:06:05.178
<i>please put your
hands together...</i> I'll take that.

854
01:06:05.352 --> 01:06:08.225
[host] <i>...for Skye Riley.</i>

855
01:06:08.399 --> 01:06:09.878
[applause]

856
01:06:13.056 --> 01:06:14.883
[cheering]

857
01:06:17.712 --> 01:06:18.931
[Skye] Wow.

858
01:06:19.105 --> 01:06:20.541
Thank you.

859
01:06:22.108 --> 01:06:23.631
Thank you so much.

860
01:06:28.897 --> 01:06:30.725
Good evening,
ladies and gentlemen.

861
01:06:30.899 --> 01:06:32.771
I'm Skye Riley,

862
01:06:32.945 --> 01:06:34.294
and I'm here tonight to...

863
01:06:35.556 --> 01:06:36.601
Uh...

864
01:06:38.951 --> 01:06:40.953
[crowd whispering indistinctly]

865
01:06:41.867 --> 01:06:44.000
I'm here tonight to...

866
01:06:44.609 --> 01:06:45.784
Uh...

867
01:06:45.958 --> 01:06:47.960
Oh, that's, uh...

868
01:06:48.134 --> 01:06:50.093
[clears throat, clicks tongue]

869
01:06:54.097 --> 01:06:55.881
[sighs]

870
01:06:56.055 --> 01:06:58.405
So, how's everyone
doing tonight?

871
01:06:58.579 --> 01:07:00.842
Hope you're all
enjoying the party.

872
01:07:01.017 --> 01:07:03.628
Uh. Don't worry, though.
I'm sober. [chuckles]

873
01:07:03.802 --> 01:07:05.064
So... [sucks teeth]

874
01:07:08.763 --> 01:07:10.765
Um... [clicks tongue]

875
01:07:14.639 --> 01:07:18.251
What can I say about
how music inspires hope?

876
01:07:18.425 --> 01:07:19.818
Well,

877
01:07:19.992 --> 01:07:22.212
music gave me
everything I ever wanted.

878
01:07:23.909 --> 01:07:28.218
Then again, music did almost
kill me, so there's that.

879
01:07:28.392 --> 01:07:31.090
[chuckles] Uh... Well, I...
I guess that's not fair.

880
01:07:31.264 --> 01:07:33.049
Music didn't put
all those drugs up my nose,

881
01:07:33.223 --> 01:07:34.223
I did.

882
01:07:34.311 --> 01:07:36.182
[whispering indistinctly]

883
01:07:38.054 --> 01:07:39.577
Um...

884
01:07:42.232 --> 01:07:45.061
I... I think
I'm supposed to be up here

885
01:07:45.235 --> 01:07:50.457
offering words of inspiration
and advice.

886
01:07:50.631 --> 01:07:53.069
Well, when I think about
what I wish someone would have

887
01:07:53.243 --> 01:07:56.550
told me when I was younger
and first getting started,

888
01:07:57.290 --> 01:07:59.249
I suppose I'd say

889
01:08:00.337 --> 01:08:02.991
this business is really hard.

890
01:08:03.166 --> 01:08:07.779
And, uh, you'll spend years
of your life chasing success

891
01:08:07.953 --> 01:08:10.434
you know, thinking that
when it comes,

892
01:08:10.608 --> 01:08:14.438
it will magically fix,
you know, everything

893
01:08:15.482 --> 01:08:18.181
that's bad and wrong about you.

894
01:08:18.355 --> 01:08:21.009
And then you achieve success,
and you realize that it can't fix

895
01:08:21.184 --> 01:08:23.751
the deeply broken person
that you have always been.

896
01:08:23.925 --> 01:08:26.885
And now you can't escape

897
01:08:27.059 --> 01:08:29.844
the miserable thing
that you've become,

898
01:08:30.018 --> 01:08:31.411
and one day, you realize

899
01:08:31.585 --> 01:08:33.021
how badly you wish you could

900
01:08:33.196 --> 01:08:34.719
just trade it all just for

901
01:08:34.893 --> 01:08:36.173
one fucking moment of happiness!

902
01:08:36.242 --> 01:08:37.242
[clears throat]

903
01:08:46.426 --> 01:08:48.385
Oh. [chuckles]

904
01:08:48.559 --> 01:08:49.908
Sorry about that. Uh...

905
01:08:50.082 --> 01:08:51.301
[inhales sharply]

906
01:08:55.131 --> 01:08:57.481
What I meant to say is:

907
01:08:57.655 --> 01:09:01.137
I hope the next generation
of young artists

908
01:09:01.311 --> 01:09:04.488
finds themselves
truly inspired tonight.

909
01:09:04.662 --> 01:09:07.012
I know I sure am.

910
01:09:09.101 --> 01:09:12.365
And without any further ado,

911
01:09:12.539 --> 01:09:14.759
I'd like to introduce
our next guest,

912
01:09:14.933 --> 01:09:16.674
a very special person

913
01:09:16.848 --> 01:09:19.285
who surely needs
no introduction:

914
01:09:20.112 --> 01:09:21.112
Paul Hudson.

915
01:09:21.244 --> 01:09:22.593
[murmuring]

916
01:09:23.898 --> 01:09:24.943
What?

917
01:09:26.423 --> 01:09:28.164
Why does it say that?
That's not...

918
01:09:29.730 --> 01:09:30.818
This... No. Why did s...

919
01:09:32.951 --> 01:09:33.952
This... Why did...

920
01:09:35.171 --> 01:09:37.434
What?[murmuring continues]

921
01:09:45.268 --> 01:09:46.443
No.

922
01:09:48.706 --> 01:09:49.750
No.

923
01:09:53.319 --> 01:09:54.755
No.

924
01:09:54.929 --> 01:09:56.148
No, stay away from me.

925
01:09:56.322 --> 01:09:58.281
Stay away from me!

926
01:09:59.760 --> 01:10:00.848
Paul's dead!

927
01:10:01.022 --> 01:10:02.633
You're not Paul!

928
01:10:02.807 --> 01:10:05.201
Stop smiling at me!

929
01:10:08.595 --> 01:10:09.595
No, no.

930
01:10:09.727 --> 01:10:11.555
[groaning]

931
01:10:12.860 --> 01:10:14.862
I can hold it. No, no, stop.

932
01:10:24.307 --> 01:10:25.308
[stammers]

933
01:10:43.021 --> 01:10:44.109
[screams]

934
01:10:44.283 --> 01:10:46.198
[screams][clamoring]

935
01:11:11.441 --> 01:11:14.052
[no audible dialogue]

936
01:11:59.663 --> 01:12:01.317
[message alert]

937
01:12:16.636 --> 01:12:18.159
[message alert]

938
01:12:27.821 --> 01:12:28.822
Okay.

939
01:12:33.566 --> 01:12:34.567
[message alert]

940
01:12:45.273 --> 01:12:47.363
[Lewis breathing shakily]

941
01:13:06.991 --> 01:13:10.168
[door creaks]

942
01:13:16.043 --> 01:13:17.828
[continues breathing shakily]

943
01:13:39.676 --> 01:13:43.723
[whispers] <i>Okay.
Okay. Okay. Okay.</i>

944
01:13:43.897 --> 01:13:47.423
[sniffing, breathing shakily]

945
01:14:12.883 --> 01:14:14.232
[whispering] <i>Do you see it?</i>

946
01:14:22.893 --> 01:14:24.938
<i>It just stares at me,</i>

947
01:14:25.112 --> 01:14:26.810
<i>smiling.</i>

948
01:14:29.247 --> 01:14:31.249
Skye![screams]

949
01:15:17.469 --> 01:15:18.775
[elevator dings]

950
01:15:27.827 --> 01:15:29.612
[phone ringing]

951
01:15:39.273 --> 01:15:41.406
[rock music playing][indistinct chatter]

952
01:16:11.088 --> 01:16:13.394
Thank you for agreeing to see...
Wait, what are you doing?

953
01:16:13.569 --> 01:16:16.746
Sending a photo of you to my friend
in case you're some kind of creep.

954
01:16:16.920 --> 01:16:18.443
What? I'm not a creep.

955
01:16:18.617 --> 01:16:20.576
Yeah, that's what
every creep says.

956
01:16:24.057 --> 01:16:26.233
Look, I realize
you're super famous,

957
01:16:26.407 --> 01:16:29.280
and I invaded your
privacy. I apologize.

958
01:16:29.454 --> 01:16:31.195
This is also
very weird for me.

959
01:16:31.369 --> 01:16:32.769
- How do you know Lewis?
- I don't.

960
01:16:32.936 --> 01:16:35.199
I... I didn't.
[clears throat]

961
01:16:35.373 --> 01:16:37.375
I was trying to
contact Lewis to warn him.

962
01:16:37.549 --> 01:16:39.549
Tracked down his address
and went to his apartment.

963
01:16:39.682 --> 01:16:42.008
The front door was unlocked,
and he was already dead inside.

964
01:16:42.032 --> 01:16:44.556
I checked his phone, and you were
the last person he texted with.

965
01:16:44.730 --> 01:16:47.733
W-What were you trying
to warn him about?

966
01:16:47.907 --> 01:16:51.345
I'm aware that what I'm about to say
is going to sound completely insane,

967
01:16:51.519 --> 01:16:53.783
but Lewis didn't kill himself.

968
01:16:53.957 --> 01:16:58.309
He was systematically infected,
possessed and then murdered

969
01:16:58.483 --> 01:17:01.007
by some kind
of metaphysical being.

970
01:17:01.181 --> 01:17:03.314
What the fuck
are you talking about?

971
01:17:03.488 --> 01:17:08.145
If it helps, you might call it
a... a spirit or a demon.

972
01:17:08.319 --> 01:17:11.061
Maybe. I have no clue
what this thing is!

973
01:17:11.235 --> 01:17:13.193
But it disguises itself

974
01:17:13.367 --> 01:17:16.936
to look like people.
Like smiling people.

975
01:17:17.110 --> 01:17:19.896
But only the person that's
been infected by it can see it.

976
01:17:20.070 --> 01:17:22.986
No, that's... that's not real.
That's some supernatural bullshit.

977
01:17:23.160 --> 01:17:25.466
But you've seen it,
haven't you?

978
01:17:25.641 --> 01:17:27.555
That's why you're still
sitting here.

979
01:17:27.730 --> 01:17:28.861
[phone buzzing]

980
01:17:31.211 --> 01:17:33.649
[sighs] I...

981
01:17:33.823 --> 01:17:35.663
I don't know.
I don't know what's happening.

982
01:17:35.694 --> 01:17:37.870
I feel like I'm losing
my goddamn mind!

983
01:17:38.044 --> 01:17:40.240
That's precisely what this thing does to you.
It's what it did to Lewis

984
01:17:40.264 --> 01:17:42.483
while it was latched onto him.
It's like a parasite

985
01:17:42.658 --> 01:17:44.442
that infects the host
through their mind.

986
01:17:44.616 --> 01:17:47.227
In less than a week,
it drives the host insane.

987
01:17:47.401 --> 01:17:49.926
It's like it feeds off
all the bad shit in their head,

988
01:17:50.100 --> 01:17:52.319
and then
once it's done feeding,

989
01:17:52.493 --> 01:17:55.192
it forces the host to kill
themself in front of a witness.

990
01:17:55.366 --> 01:17:57.716
And then that witness
becomes the new host.

991
01:17:57.890 --> 01:17:59.370
That's how you got it
from Lewis.

992
01:17:59.544 --> 01:18:02.112
It was passed to Lewis
by a cop in Jersey.

993
01:18:02.286 --> 01:18:03.872
That cop was the first one
I tried to contact,

994
01:18:03.896 --> 01:18:05.724
but I guess he went
off the grid.

995
01:18:05.898 --> 01:18:07.615
That cop caught it
from some doctor, who got it

996
01:18:07.639 --> 01:18:09.225
from a patient, who got it
from a college professor.

997
01:18:09.249 --> 01:18:10.903
And the chain
keeps going back.

998
01:18:11.077 --> 01:18:12.862
I've documented all of this.
I can show you.

999
01:18:13.036 --> 01:18:14.316
Why do you even know
all of this?

1000
01:18:14.472 --> 01:18:16.692
Because it killed my brother.

1001
01:18:17.693 --> 01:18:19.825
My brother was a host

1002
01:18:19.999 --> 01:18:23.002
eight people before you.

1003
01:18:23.176 --> 01:18:25.178
He tried to tell me
what was happening to him.

1004
01:18:25.352 --> 01:18:27.050
But he made it hard
to trust him,

1005
01:18:27.224 --> 01:18:28.399
and the stuff he was saying

1006
01:18:29.313 --> 01:18:32.316
sounded certifiably crazy.

1007
01:18:32.490 --> 01:18:36.407
He begged me for help.
But I didn't listen.

1008
01:18:36.581 --> 01:18:38.801
And then a few days later...
[inhales sharply]

1009
01:18:38.975 --> 01:18:40.541
...I got a call informing me

1010
01:18:40.716 --> 01:18:42.935
that he tore his own jaw off
with a crowbar.

1011
01:18:49.115 --> 01:18:51.435
Well, have you gone
to the police?[chuckling] And say what?

1012
01:18:51.596 --> 01:18:53.729
My brother's suicide
was actually caused

1013
01:18:53.903 --> 01:18:57.123
by some cosmic evil being
that no one else can see?

1014
01:18:57.297 --> 01:18:59.169
The police can't
stop this thing anyway.

1015
01:18:59.343 --> 01:19:01.277
So I'm just supposed to wait
until this thing kills me?

1016
01:19:01.301 --> 01:19:02.520
No, I want you

1017
01:19:02.694 --> 01:19:05.001
- to help me destroy it.
- How?

1018
01:19:05.175 --> 01:19:08.395
From what I can tell,
the chain stops

1019
01:19:08.569 --> 01:19:12.051
when an infected host dies
in some other way

1020
01:19:12.225 --> 01:19:14.184
outside of the being's control.

1021
01:19:14.358 --> 01:19:17.317
My guess is that,
just like other parasites,

1022
01:19:17.491 --> 01:19:18.623
without a living host

1023
01:19:18.797 --> 01:19:20.364
it has no way to survive.

1024
01:19:20.538 --> 01:19:22.888
It ceases to exist.

1025
01:19:23.062 --> 01:19:24.629
So it only stops if...

1026
01:19:24.803 --> 01:19:26.283
if I die before it kills me?

1027
01:19:26.457 --> 01:19:28.154
Exactly. We need
to kill you first.

1028
01:19:28.328 --> 01:19:29.852
What?

1029
01:19:30.026 --> 01:19:32.768
Only technically. Look.

1030
01:19:32.942 --> 01:19:36.336
There are ways that we can
very safely stop your heart.

1031
01:19:36.510 --> 01:19:39.035
That'll deprive it
of a living host.

1032
01:19:39.209 --> 01:19:40.906
Once it goes,

1033
01:19:41.080 --> 01:19:42.960
I can resuscitate your heart
and bring you back.

1034
01:19:43.126 --> 01:19:44.867
Are you
out of your fucking mind?

1035
01:19:45.041 --> 01:19:46.346
I know it seems extreme.

1036
01:19:46.520 --> 01:19:47.960
"Extreme"?
You're asking to kill me!

1037
01:19:48.131 --> 01:19:50.089
Whoa, hey. Just keep it down.

1038
01:19:50.263 --> 01:19:52.178
I don't even know you.
I don't even know you!

1039
01:19:52.352 --> 01:19:54.354
My name is Morris.
I'm an ER nurse,

1040
01:19:54.528 --> 01:19:56.530
and if we don't do this,
it's gonna kill you

1041
01:19:56.704 --> 01:19:58.750
like it killed Lewis
and infect another victim.

1042
01:19:58.924 --> 01:20:00.883
Look, I've already got
everything prepared.

1043
01:20:01.057 --> 01:20:03.257
We should just go now and
get rid of this thing tonight.

1044
01:20:04.930 --> 01:20:08.499
- I can't. I can't do this.
- You're nearly out of time!

1045
01:20:08.673 --> 01:20:11.110
This thing has been feeding
on you for three days already!

1046
01:20:11.284 --> 01:20:13.939
It's already taking control
of your brain, and pretty soon

1047
01:20:14.113 --> 01:20:16.333
you won't even realize
the ways it's manipulating you,

1048
01:20:16.507 --> 01:20:19.510
and then it'll be too late to stop it.
We have to go right now.

1049
01:20:19.684 --> 01:20:22.165
[onlooker] Is that Skye Riley?[drunk person 1]
Holy shit. Dude.

1050
01:20:22.339 --> 01:20:24.645
That's Skye?[onlooker 2] It's Skye Riley!

1051
01:20:24.820 --> 01:20:27.779
- Would you do a quick TikTok with us?
- Skye Riley!

1052
01:20:27.953 --> 01:20:31.261
I watched that video where you
knocked down that old lady like fifty times!

1053
01:20:31.435 --> 01:20:33.045
That shit was so fucking funny.

1054
01:20:33.219 --> 01:20:35.569
- [grunts, laughs]
- [people in bar clamoring]

1055
01:20:35.743 --> 01:20:37.049
[drunk person 3] Skye!

1056
01:20:37.876 --> 01:20:39.399
Skye, can I get your autograph?

1057
01:22:09.359 --> 01:22:10.360
[yells]

1058
01:22:10.838 --> 01:22:12.014
Fuck!

1059
01:22:12.188 --> 01:22:13.189
[grunts]

1060
01:22:14.016 --> 01:22:15.191
Fuck!

1061
01:22:25.462 --> 01:22:27.116
Fuck!

1062
01:22:29.988 --> 01:22:30.989
- [tears]
- [grunts]

1063
01:22:35.472 --> 01:22:37.474
Fuck!

1064
01:22:38.040 --> 01:22:39.128
[screams]

1065
01:22:43.349 --> 01:22:46.309
[gasping, wheezing]

1066
01:23:36.228 --> 01:23:39.057
[grunting]

1067
01:23:57.162 --> 01:23:58.772
[breathing shakily]

1068
01:24:52.522 --> 01:24:53.566
[swallows]

1069
01:25:21.203 --> 01:25:22.595
[light bulb shatters]

1070
01:25:53.017 --> 01:25:54.540
[screams]

1071
01:25:55.237 --> 01:25:56.847
No! No!

1072
01:25:57.021 --> 01:25:59.154
Don't! No!

1073
01:26:00.155 --> 01:26:02.896
[grunting]

1074
01:26:05.290 --> 01:26:07.423
No! No! No!

1075
01:26:07.945 --> 01:26:08.989
No!

1076
01:26:11.340 --> 01:26:12.341
[grunts]

1077
01:26:16.171 --> 01:26:17.302
Get off!

1078
01:26:17.476 --> 01:26:19.957
[grunting, shrieking]

1079
01:26:22.394 --> 01:26:24.962
- [screaming]
- [tearing]

1080
01:26:29.009 --> 01:26:31.011
[gagging, choking]

1081
01:26:32.491 --> 01:26:34.450
[bones cracking]

1082
01:27:18.276 --> 01:27:19.277
[clears throat]

1083
01:27:25.501 --> 01:27:26.589
[Paul] What?

1084
01:27:26.763 --> 01:27:27.938
What?

1085
01:27:28.112 --> 01:27:29.244
- [Paul] What?
- What?

1086
01:27:30.767 --> 01:27:32.682
Oh, Jesus Christ.

1087
01:27:34.249 --> 01:27:36.555
Are you crying right now?

1088
01:27:36.729 --> 01:27:39.166
I'm... I'm not crying. [sniffs][laughs]

1089
01:27:39.341 --> 01:27:40.994
Are you crying?

1090
01:27:41.604 --> 01:27:43.083
[sniffs]

1091
01:27:43.258 --> 01:27:45.303
Hmm? Huh?[clears throat]

1092
01:27:45.477 --> 01:27:48.611
Hey! Hey, I'm fucking
talking to you!

1093
01:27:50.613 --> 01:27:52.267
["Boss" playing loudly
on radio]

1094
01:27:53.746 --> 01:27:55.052
Are you fucking kidding me?

1095
01:27:55.226 --> 01:27:56.466
What the fuck
is wrong with you?

1096
01:27:56.619 --> 01:27:57.881
What the fuck is wrong with me?

1097
01:27:58.055 --> 01:27:59.709
What the fuck
is wrong with you, huh?

1098
01:27:59.883 --> 01:28:01.580
I don't know! I don't know!

1099
01:28:01.754 --> 01:28:03.384
I don't know, Paul.
Why don't you tell me,

1100
01:28:03.408 --> 01:28:05.062
since I can't
do anything right?

1101
01:28:05.236 --> 01:28:07.630
Jesus Christ! I swear...

1102
01:28:07.804 --> 01:28:10.197
I swear to fucking God,
you are so...

1103
01:28:10.372 --> 01:28:11.938
What? What? What?

1104
01:28:12.112 --> 01:28:15.072
I'm so fucking what?
Say it. What am I?

1105
01:28:15.246 --> 01:28:17.727
Tell me, I am so fucking...

1106
01:28:18.728 --> 01:28:20.643
You're fucking psycho!

1107
01:28:20.817 --> 01:28:22.427
- Oh, yay!
- Yeah!

1108
01:28:22.601 --> 01:28:25.082
- Psycho!
- It's out of the bag!

1109
01:28:25.256 --> 01:28:26.997
You're fucking crazy![cheers]

1110
01:28:27.171 --> 01:28:28.781
I'll show you crazy!

1111
01:28:28.955 --> 01:28:30.995
- You want to fucking see crazy?
- Stop it! Stop it!

1112
01:28:31.131 --> 01:28:33.066
- What are you doing?
- Is that crazy enough for you?

1113
01:28:33.090 --> 01:28:35.614
- Is that fucked up? Huh?
- Stop it!

1114
01:28:35.788 --> 01:28:37.723
- Is that crazy enough for you?
- Yes, that is crazy,

1115
01:28:37.747 --> 01:28:39.923
you fucking psycho!

1116
01:28:40.097 --> 01:28:43.230
Jesus fucking Christ!
I'm fucking driving.

1117
01:28:43.405 --> 01:28:47.104
- [grunts] Fucking hate you!
- Good! Good!

1118
01:28:47.278 --> 01:28:50.803
'Cause I fucking hate you, too.
I fucking... [sighs]

1119
01:28:52.065 --> 01:28:53.589
You crazy bitch.

1120
01:28:53.763 --> 01:28:55.591
[cackling]

1121
01:28:56.766 --> 01:28:59.595
Ah, you psycho bitch!

1122
01:29:01.814 --> 01:29:04.469
[mock crying]
Oh, you're gonna cry.

1123
01:29:04.643 --> 01:29:07.994
Are you gonna cry now?
Is that your thing? "Oh, God!"

1124
01:29:08.168 --> 01:29:12.042
Oh, you look so fucking ugly
when you cry. It's horrible.

1125
01:29:12.216 --> 01:29:15.350
I can't... Ew, I can't...
[mock gags]

1126
01:29:17.264 --> 01:29:21.007
"Oh, help me, God!"

1127
01:29:21.181 --> 01:29:22.792
[mock sobbing]

1128
01:29:24.707 --> 01:29:26.883
[screams]
What the fuck are you doing?

1129
01:29:27.057 --> 01:29:28.493
What are you doing?

1130
01:29:28.667 --> 01:29:32.758
[horn blares][Paul] Jesus! Oh, my God!

1131
01:29:32.932 --> 01:29:34.760
[metal crunches][gasps]

1132
01:29:36.893 --> 01:29:40.375
It's okay, it's okay.
Everything's fine. Hey, hey.

1133
01:29:41.637 --> 01:29:42.638
You're okay.

1134
01:29:43.987 --> 01:29:45.858
You have a mild concussion.

1135
01:29:53.605 --> 01:29:55.302
Where am I? Where am I?

1136
01:29:55.477 --> 01:29:58.218
Harvest Moon.
It's a private wellness clinic.

1137
01:29:58.393 --> 01:30:00.569
You fainted and hit your head.

1138
01:30:00.743 --> 01:30:04.050
We found you lying
on your living room floor,

1139
01:30:04.224 --> 01:30:05.704
unconscious.

1140
01:30:05.878 --> 01:30:07.619
The doctor said
you were sleep deprived

1141
01:30:07.793 --> 01:30:09.752
and extremely dehydrated.

1142
01:30:09.926 --> 01:30:12.189
No, no, no, that's not...

1143
01:30:12.363 --> 01:30:13.963
That's not...
That's not what happened.

1144
01:30:14.017 --> 01:30:15.932
Joshua, could you go
find Dr. Fowler

1145
01:30:16.106 --> 01:30:18.500
- and let him know Skye's awake?
- Of course, yeah.

1146
01:30:18.674 --> 01:30:21.241
I hope you're
feeling better, Skye.

1147
01:30:21.416 --> 01:30:25.420
I, uh... I brought a sweatshirt
for you, just in case you...

1148
01:30:26.638 --> 01:30:27.987
...you get cold.

1149
01:30:43.394 --> 01:30:46.005
[Elizabeth]
We can cover that with makeup.

1150
01:30:46.179 --> 01:30:49.139
And the team's already working
on a fill piece for your hair.

1151
01:30:54.100 --> 01:30:56.538
Don't worry, you won't be able
to tell the difference.

1152
01:30:57.843 --> 01:30:59.976
And I've cleared your schedule.

1153
01:31:00.150 --> 01:31:02.326
So today you can
just have a whole day

1154
01:31:02.500 --> 01:31:04.589
of rest and recuperation.

1155
01:31:04.763 --> 01:31:07.505
[Skye whimpering]
Where's my phone?

1156
01:31:07.679 --> 01:31:09.004
- I need my phone.
- It's right here.

1157
01:31:09.028 --> 01:31:10.508
I got it.

1158
01:31:10.682 --> 01:31:13.163
- I need it. Give it to me.
- Maybe later.

1159
01:31:13.337 --> 01:31:16.732
Right now, we're just
gonna focus on relaxing.

1160
01:31:16.906 --> 01:31:20.344
[whispering] Mom.
Please, please.

1161
01:31:20.518 --> 01:31:22.215
Something really crazy
is happening to me.

1162
01:31:22.389 --> 01:31:23.869
I need to get out of here
right now.

1163
01:31:24.043 --> 01:31:27.525
No. We are gonna
stay here together

1164
01:31:27.699 --> 01:31:30.615
until we head to the venue
tomorrow for the preshow.

1165
01:31:30.789 --> 01:31:32.878
That way we can make sure
you're a hundred percent

1166
01:31:33.052 --> 01:31:34.793
and ready to perform.

1167
01:31:34.967 --> 01:31:36.491
No, no. I can't. I...

1168
01:31:36.665 --> 01:31:38.014
Can't what?

1169
01:31:38.971 --> 01:31:40.059
[breathes shakily]

1170
01:31:41.844 --> 01:31:43.323
I can't do the show.

1171
01:31:45.282 --> 01:31:49.634
If you... cancel the show,
then you will be

1172
01:31:49.808 --> 01:31:52.985
checking yourself into
a recovery program.

1173
01:31:53.159 --> 01:31:55.727
That's the only
explanation... Mom...

1174
01:31:55.901 --> 01:31:58.121
...as to why Skye Riley
is canceling another tour

1175
01:31:58.295 --> 01:31:59.470
the night before it starts.

1176
01:31:59.644 --> 01:32:01.472
You will have to explain
to the label

1177
01:32:01.646 --> 01:32:03.605
who've invested
millions of dollars.

1178
01:32:03.779 --> 01:32:06.259
And you're putting the workers... Mom, you don't understand!

1179
01:32:06.346 --> 01:32:09.306
No! You don't
understand, Skye.

1180
01:32:09.480 --> 01:32:11.743
There are
no more second chances.

1181
01:32:11.917 --> 01:32:15.007
If you cancel, this is it.

1182
01:32:15.181 --> 01:32:17.967
The media will rake you
over the coals.

1183
01:32:18.141 --> 01:32:20.230
We'll be sued
by the label for millions.

1184
01:32:20.404 --> 01:32:23.973
It will be the end
of everything we've built.

1185
01:32:25.322 --> 01:32:26.976
[sobbing] Oh, my God, Mom.

1186
01:32:27.150 --> 01:32:29.544
Why is that
all you care about, Mom?

1187
01:32:29.718 --> 01:32:32.938
You treat me like
I'm some fucking windup toy.

1188
01:32:33.112 --> 01:32:34.505
You don't give a shit about me!

1189
01:32:34.679 --> 01:32:36.768
How dare you
talk to me like that?

1190
01:32:36.942 --> 01:32:38.248
You arrogant little asshole!

1191
01:32:38.422 --> 01:32:40.642
I have given up
everything for you!

1192
01:32:40.816 --> 01:32:42.513
Every second of my time.

1193
01:32:42.687 --> 01:32:44.297
Years of my life.

1194
01:32:45.255 --> 01:32:47.997
My career.
And here I am,

1195
01:32:48.171 --> 01:32:53.002
sacrificing every fiber
of my being to support you.

1196
01:32:53.176 --> 01:32:56.005
But you're too selfish
to even see it.

1197
01:32:56.179 --> 01:32:59.835
You put everyone
through absolute hell,

1198
01:33:00.009 --> 01:33:02.620
and still we support you.

1199
01:33:02.794 --> 01:33:05.667
But you want to go
and throw it away? Fine!

1200
01:33:05.841 --> 01:33:08.408
Do it! Throw it away!
I don't care!

1201
01:33:08.583 --> 01:33:10.976
That's what everyone expects
of you anyway.

1202
01:33:13.762 --> 01:33:16.416
I wish you could feel
what it's like

1203
01:33:16.591 --> 01:33:18.723
having to live inside my head.

1204
01:33:23.032 --> 01:33:25.140
[in demonic voice] I've tasted
what's inside your head!

1205
01:33:25.164 --> 01:33:26.905
[sobbing] No, no, please, no!

1206
01:33:27.079 --> 01:33:29.038
Please, no.

1207
01:33:29.212 --> 01:33:30.256
No.

1208
01:33:34.173 --> 01:33:36.654
No, no, no! Please!

1209
01:33:36.828 --> 01:33:38.221
No!

1210
01:33:38.395 --> 01:33:39.614
[grunting]

1211
01:33:42.051 --> 01:33:43.879
Oh, no, no!

1212
01:33:44.053 --> 01:33:45.445
[breathes heavily]

1213
01:33:46.403 --> 01:33:48.623
[grunting]

1214
01:33:56.456 --> 01:33:59.938
Look what you're doing
to your poor mother.

1215
01:34:00.112 --> 01:34:02.245
[Skye crying]

1216
01:34:02.419 --> 01:34:03.550
No, God!

1217
01:34:05.988 --> 01:34:07.293
[groans]

1218
01:34:27.836 --> 01:34:29.185
[breathes shakily]

1219
01:34:48.595 --> 01:34:49.640
[gasps]

1220
01:35:17.581 --> 01:35:19.322
[Elizabeth choking]

1221
01:35:24.283 --> 01:35:26.285
[whispering]
Oh, God, that's not real.

1222
01:35:26.459 --> 01:35:29.114
It's not real. It's not real.

1223
01:35:29.288 --> 01:35:30.637
It's not real.

1224
01:35:31.334 --> 01:35:32.596
No, no.

1225
01:35:32.770 --> 01:35:34.076
[screams] No!

1226
01:35:35.991 --> 01:35:39.211
It's not real, it's not real,
it's not real. [inhales deeply]

1227
01:35:41.997 --> 01:35:43.476
[gasping]

1228
01:35:49.265 --> 01:35:50.745
[shakily] Oh...

1229
01:35:52.224 --> 01:35:53.225
Oh!

1230
01:35:54.400 --> 01:35:57.099
[gasps, sobs]

1231
01:36:10.112 --> 01:36:11.766
[knocking on door][gasps]

1232
01:36:11.940 --> 01:36:13.593
It's Joshua!

1233
01:36:17.293 --> 01:36:19.338
[door opening]
I need a second!

1234
01:36:19.512 --> 01:36:22.080
I'm changing.[Joshua] Oh! Sorry! Uh...

1235
01:36:22.254 --> 01:36:24.213
You know what?
I'll wait out here.

1236
01:36:24.387 --> 01:36:26.234
Also, the doctor said
he's gonna come and see you

1237
01:36:26.258 --> 01:36:27.258
in a few minutes.

1238
01:36:27.346 --> 01:36:29.435
Actually, I...

1239
01:36:29.609 --> 01:36:32.699
I... I feel kind of thirsty.
I need a...

1240
01:36:32.874 --> 01:36:34.939
Do you think you could go
find me something to drink?

1241
01:36:34.963 --> 01:36:37.139
Oh. Uh, I brought
some bottles of water.

1242
01:36:37.313 --> 01:36:39.445
Put them
in the little refrigerator.

1243
01:36:39.619 --> 01:36:41.926
I feel like soda. Could you
get me a soda, please?

